# File: tests/bdd/features/generate_audio.feature
# Generated from: specs/242-add-a-generate-audio-skill-that-enforces-one-take-instrumental-brief-faithful-elevenlabs-generation/requirements.md
Feature: Generate game audio through /generate-audio

  @SCN001
  Scenario: The first single-take audio generation in a session gets the routing reminder
    Given an empty hook state directory
    When the audio guard hook receives a creative_generate_in_flow event with node_type "music" and generations_count 1 for session "s-1"
    Then it exits 0
    And its additionalContext names /generate-audio and nmg-game-dev:generate-audio
    And it makes no permission decision

  @SCN002
  Scenario: A multi-take audio generation is denied
    Given an empty hook state directory
    When the audio guard hook receives a creative_generate_speech event with generations_count 3 for session "s-1"
    Then it exits 0
    And its permissionDecision is "deny"
    And its permissionDecisionReason states generations_count: 1 and names /generate-audio

  @SCN003
  Scenario: A repeat single-take call in the same session passes silently
    Given the audio guard hook has already reminded session "s-1"
    When the audio guard hook receives a creative_generate_in_flow event with node_type "sfx" and generations_count 1 for session "s-1"
    Then it exits 0 with empty stdout

  @SCN004
  Scenario: Unreadable hook input fails open
    Given an empty hook state directory
    When the audio guard hook receives "not json" on stdin
    Then it exits 0 with empty stdout

  @SCN005
  Scenario: The skill makes music instrumental unless vocals come with lyrics
    Given the body of skills/generate-audio/SKILL.md
    When its music instructions are read
    Then they direct setting the instrumental option read from creative_get_model_schema unless the user asked for vocals and supplied lyrics
    And they direct using only the user's lyrics when vocals are requested

  @SCN006
  Scenario: The skill builds prompts only from the brief
    Given the body of skills/generate-audio/SKILL.md
    When its prompt instructions are read
    Then they direct reading creative_get_model_guide and the design-doc entry such as docs/design/systems/audio.md
    And they forbid adding any genre, instrument, mood, or vocal element absent from the request and design doc
    And they direct generations_count: 1 and importing with import_audio

  @SCN007
  Scenario: Non-audio ElevenLabs generation is left alone
    Given an empty hook state directory
    When the audio guard hook receives a creative_generate_in_flow event with node_type "image" and generations_count 4 for session "s-1"
    Then it exits 0 with empty stdout
    And no reminder marker is written
